message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - family-names: Barry
    given-names: Dave
    email: david.barry@crick.ac.uk
    affiliation: Francis Crick Institute
title: "CrosstalkPy"
abstract: >-
  A PyTorch model that detects crosstalk (bleed-through) in fluorescence
  microscopy image pairs. Given a "mixed" channel and its "pure" source channel,
  it regresses a scalar alpha value in [0,1] describing the crosstalk mixing
  ratio.
keywords:
  - microscopy
  - crosstalk
  - deep learning
  - pytorch
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/djpbarry/Torch-Unet"
version: "0.1.0"
